          "nudge_reason": null,
          "final_text_tail": "on Helper (`_canonicalize_tool_args`)**\n   - Implemented in [`dspy/adapters/types/tool.py`](file:///private/var/folders/3q/2m8v425s7p39t7qxjp0kcdw80000gn/T/parbench-host-abp1g1f8/repo/dspy/adapters/types/tool.py).\n   - Recursively sorts dictionary keys.\n   - Converts tuples into lists.\n   - Trims leading and trailing whitespace from string values.\n   - Leaves numeric, boolean, and other primitive values unchanged.\n\n2. **Fingerprint & ID Computation on `ToolCalls.ToolCall`**\n   - Added read-only (`Field(default=\"\", frozen=True)`) fields `fingerprint: str` and `id: str` to [`ToolCalls.ToolCall`](file:///private/var/folders/3q/2m8v425s7p39t7qxjp0kcdw80000gn/T/parbench-host-abp1g1f8/repo/dspy/adapters/types/tool.py#L274-L295).\n   - During `__init__`, canonicalizes `args`, constructs an object containing the tool `name` and the canonicalized `args`, serializes it with `json.dumps(..., sort_keys=True, separators=(\",\", \":\"))`, and hashes it with SHA-256.\n   - Sets `fingerprint` to the 64-character SHA-256 hexadecimal digest and `id` to the first 8 characters.\n\n3. **Unit Tests**\n   - Added comprehensive tests in [`tests/adapters/test_tool.py`](file:///private/var/folders/3q/2m8v425s7p39t7qxjp0kcdw80000gn/T/parbench-host-abp1g1f8/repo/tests/adapters/test_tool.py#L462-L510) verifying deterministic fingerprints across key orderings, whitespace trimming, tuple/list handling, type distinction (bool vs str), tool name differentiation, nested structures, and read-only property enforcement.\n",
